WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,300
Forget it, let's go there by ourselves

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:05,500
These two guys don't recognize anyone

3
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,550
Old ghost, the big man is so seriously injured

4
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:18,950
Can you do it?

5
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:25,700
My medical skills are the most invincible

6
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,220
You don’t want to fly with me, do you?

7
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,900
I used him to prepare poison before.

8
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:34,720
None of the medicine in my hand is poison.

9
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:38,940
Although this is not poison, it can be mixed with hundreds of strange poisons

10
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:42,560
In the same way, I can also prepare life-saving medicine.

11
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:46,720
I am smarter in treating people than using poison.

12
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:50,600
Using poison is only for self-preservation. Treating people is the foundation of life.

13
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:54,130
Be careful, old ghost. What are you doing?

14
00:00:54,130 --> 00:00:57,730
I have practiced Changchun Qi for nearly a hundred years

15
00:00:57,730 --> 00:01:00,930
Its breath simulates the natural breath of the world

16
00:01:00,930 --> 00:01:02,770
Just for ordinary people

17
00:01:02,770 --> 00:01:05,530
But it really works wonders for these two
